  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 801.04 Co-Disposal of Wastes Prohibited",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 801.04 Co-Disposal of Wastes Prohibited. Hazardous waste as defined in RSA 147-A or solid waste as defined in RSA 149-M, except for wood ash certified for use under Env-Sw 1700 and waste derived products certified for use under Env-Sw 1500, shall not be disposed or processed at a site or facility permitted under this chapter.\n\nSource. #10998, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14571, eff 5-15-26, EXPIRES: 5-15-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq800.html"
